gence data center to the Portneuf Valley. Somewhere around a hundred citizens gathered in the Pocatello City Council Chambers Thursday evening to find out how council members would vote on the appeal made by Lex Developments. After […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},